        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Space travel has been possible for some time and some people claim that space tourism could be developed in the future. Do you think it is a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEVwdijUVok75JxSbZslExvwgdi\"><em><strong>Space travel has been possible for some time and some people claim that space tourism could be developed in the future. Do you think it is a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Space tourism <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề <em>Space tourism</em> cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Du h&agrave;nh vũ trụ gần đ&acirc;y đ&atilde; trở th&agrave;nh sự thật v&agrave; một số người cho rằng du lịch vũ trụ c&oacute; thể sẽ được ph&aacute;t triển trong tương lai.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Living in Mega Cities&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HW5vdeoF0oAUJRxHRYilaEAzgHf\">rapid advancement of technology&nbsp;<em>(sự ph&aacute;t triển vượt bậc của c&ocirc;ng nghệ)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>space tourism <em>(du lịch ngo&agrave;i vũ trụ)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực hơn l&agrave; t&iacute;ch cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, c&aacute;c si&ecirc;u đ&ocirc; thị mang đến nhiều cơ hội kinh tế đ&aacute;ng kể</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D85ydGvYPopsOexdQSzlI7Yvggf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBXdDtcooR4lqxVdqTl04DTg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Việc ph&aacute;t triển t&agrave;u vũ trụ cho du kh&aacute;ch đ&ograve;i hỏi <em>c&ocirc;ng nghệ ti&ecirc;n tiến (cutting-edge technology)</em>, điều n&agrave;y th&uacute;c đẩy c&aacute;c nh&agrave; khoa học v&agrave; kỹ sư<em> tạo ra những ph&aacute;t minh mới (create new innovations)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMONdXgL7oahZdxmKklljZSzgyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y l&agrave; do c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty phải cạnh tranh với nhau để cung cấp những chuyến đi an to&agrave;n v&agrave; thoải m&aacute;i hơn cho kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng, v&agrave; sự cạnh tranh n&agrave;y<em> th&uacute;c đẩy tiến bộ c&ocirc;ng nghệ (accelerates technological progress)</em> trong <em>ng&agrave;nh h&agrave;ng kh&ocirc;ng vũ trụ (aerospace industry)</em>, dẫn đến những đổi mới mang lại lợi &iacute;ch cho c&aacute;c lĩnh vực kh&aacute;c như y tế v&agrave; giao th&ocirc;ng vận tải</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUm7dcHfLo20hgxySC7lpBHxgjd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTerdTD1hoUGW0xyA5FlzI0qgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Sự ph&aacute;t triển của ng&agrave;nh h&agrave;ng kh&ocirc;ng vũ trụ tạo ra nhiều cơ hội việc l&agrave;m cho kỹ sư, phi c&ocirc;ng v&agrave; kỹ thuật vi&ecirc;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UD28dt0yGouDLExLLCOlmzSlgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> V&igrave; việc <em>vận h&agrave;nh t&agrave;u vũ trụ v&agrave; quản l&yacute; c&aacute;c chuyến du lịch (operating spacecraft and managing tourist trips)</em> đ&ograve;i hỏi một <em>lực lượng lao động dồi d&agrave;o v&agrave; c&oacute; tay nghề cao (large and highly skilled workforce)</em>, lĩnh vực n&agrave;y mang đến <em>việc l&agrave;m ổn định (provides stable employment)</em> trong một <em>ng&agrave;nh đang ph&aacute;t triển nhanh ch&oacute;ng (rapidly expanding field)</em>, mang lại lợi &iacute;ch cho cả c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; nền kinh tế chung</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: T</strong>r&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những kh&iacute;a cạnh ti&ecirc;u cực của du lịch vũ trụ vượt trội hơn những lợi &iacute;ch của n&oacute;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeX1d74K2oszJwxVwgLlOlubghg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeldoaoMokRxRxYECWljT3dg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Mối lo ngại cấp b&aacute;ch nhất l&agrave; <em>thiệt hại m&ocirc;i trường (environmental damage)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0VjdHScloZpHixcULslcAmcgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact</strong>: V&igrave; t&ecirc;n lửa phải <em>đốt h&agrave;ng trăm tấn nhi&ecirc;n liệu (burn hundreds of tons of fuel)</em> trong v&agrave;i ph&uacute;t để đến kh&ocirc;ng gian vũ trụ, việc ph&oacute;ng t&ecirc;n lửa thải ra một lượng lớn <em>kh&iacute; thải carbon (carbon emissions)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c chất &ocirc; nhiễm c&oacute; hại (harmful pollutants)</em> v&agrave;o bầu kh&iacute; quyển. Điều n&agrave;y khiến t&igrave;nh trạng <em>biến đổi kh&iacute; hậu (climate change)</em>, vốn đ&atilde; l&agrave; <em>mối đe dọa nghi&ecirc;m trọng đối với sự sống tr&ecirc;n Tr&aacute;i Đất (poses a serious threat to life on Earth)</em>, trở n&ecirc;n nghi&ecirc;m trọng hơn, n&ecirc;n <em>việc theo đuổi du h&agrave;nh vũ trụ chỉ v&igrave; mục đ&iacute;ch giải tr&iacute; thuần t&uacute;y (pursue space travel for mere entertainment purposes)</em> l&agrave; v&ocirc; tr&aacute;ch nhiệm</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx3Ud3ZRuojDvLxy5F2lhSbjgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Hơn nữa, du lịch vũ trụ l&agrave; <em>minh chứng cho sự l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n v&agrave;o c&aacute;c hoạt động kh&ocirc;ng thiết yếu (represents a waste of resources on non-essential activities)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCtCdUbRzotNVbxyv1blviIsgbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> H&agrave;ng tỷ đ&ocirc; la đang được đầu tư để <em>đưa những người gi&agrave;u c&oacute; l&ecirc;n vũ trụ để giải tr&iacute; (sending wealthy individuals to space for leisure)</em>, trong khi số tiền n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể được <em>chuyển hướng để giải quyết c&aacute;c vấn đề to&agrave;n cầu cấp b&aacute;ch hơn (redirected to address more urgent global issues)</em> như <em>ngh&egrave;o đ&oacute;i (poverty)</em>, <em>nạn đ&oacute;i (hunger)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c bệnh truyền nhiễm (infectious diseases)</em>. Bằng c&aacute;ch chuyển hướng c&aacute;c khoản tiền n&agrave;y, ch&iacute;nh phủ c&oacute; thể cung cấp lương thực, nước sạch v&agrave; dịch vụ y tế cho h&agrave;ng triệu người đang cần, qua đ&oacute; cải thiện đ&aacute;ng kể chất lượng cuộc sống của họ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>technological advancement<em> (tiến bộ về c&ocirc;ng nghệ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LhTJdBrAboq6xmx20FDlf8YtgRe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">job creation <em>(tạo th&ecirc;m việc l&agrave;m)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LhTJdBrAboq6xmx20FDlf8YtgRe\" data-list=\"bullet\">misallocation of valuable resources <em>(sự ph&acirc;n bổ nguồn lực kh&ocirc;ng hợp l&yacute;)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3149,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>With the rapid advancement of technology, it is predicted that space tourism could become a reality in the near future. Although this development may offer certain benefits, I believe the drawbacks are far more significant.</p>",
            "question_id": 41520,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3150,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, commercial space travel could bring some positive outcomes related to technology and employment.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Firstly, developing spacecraft for tourists requires cutting-edge technology, which pushes scientists and engineers to create new innovations. This is because companies must compete with each other to offer safer and more comfortable trips for their customers, and such competition accelerates technological progress in the aerospace industry, potentially leading to innovations that benefit other sectors such as medicine and transportation. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Secondly, the growth of the aerospace industry creates numerous job opportunities for engineers, pilots, and technicians. Since operating spacecraft and managing tourist trips require a large and highly skilled workforce, this sector provides stable employment in a rapidly expanding field, which benefits both individuals and the economy.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 41520,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3151,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that the negative aspects of space tourism outweigh its advantages.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">The most pressing concern is environmental damage. Since rockets must burn hundreds of tons of fuel within minutes to reach outer space, their launches release massive amounts of carbon emissions and harmful pollutants into the atmosphere. This significantly worsens climate change, which already poses a serious threat to life on Earth, making it irresponsible to pursue space travel for mere entertainment purposes. <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, space tourism represents a waste of resources on non-essential activities. Billions of dollars are being invested in sending wealthy individuals to space for leisure, while this money could be redirected to address more urgent global issues such as poverty, hunger, and infectious diseases. By redirecting these funds, governments could provide food, clean water, and healthcare for millions of people in need, significantly improving their quality of life.</span></span></p>",
            "question_id": 41520,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3152,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while space tourism may contribute to technological advancement and job creation, I believe these benefits are overshadowed by its negative impacts on the environment and the misallocation of valuable resources that could otherwise improve human welfare.</p>",
